[A Human,Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Druid][OC][L 84,65.4 Elwynn Forest]If you still need a mount and are making this detour, take the boat to Wetlands, fly to Stormwind, and go to Eastvale Logging Camp in Elwynn Forest. \\ If you still need Apprentice Riding, take *Learning to Ride* from *Randal Hunter* if offered and train with them. \\ At *Katie Hunter*, turn in *Learning to Ride* if ready and ask about *Your First Horse*. Inspect the mounts if that quest is offered. \\ If you already claimed a first-mount reward and need another mount, check the mounts for sale.[TAR384-]
