[A Gnome,Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Druid][OC][L 49.2,48 Dun Morogh]If you still need a mount and are making this detour, take the boat to Wetlands, fly to Ironforge, and go to the depot near Kharanos in Dun Morogh. \\ If you still need Apprentice Riding, take *Learning to Ride* from *Binjy Featherwhistle* if offered and train with them. \\ At *Milli Featherwhistle*, turn in *Learning to Ride* if ready and ask about *Your First Mechanostrider*. Inspect the mounts if that quest is offered. \\ If you already claimed a first-mount reward and need another mount, check the mounts for sale.[TAR7955-]
